    "plain_statement": "Plain takeaway on whether text helps:\n1. TF-IDF Text (Deployment vs Type+Priority only): Mean MAE difference is -0.0153 points. Ticket-level 95% CI is [-0.0519, 0.023] (excludes 0: False). Project-level 95% CI is [-0.0586, 0.059] (excludes 0: False). Because both confidence intervals span zero, TF-IDF text does NOT provide a statistically significant improvement over Type+Priority metadata alone.\n2. S-BERT Embeddings (S-BERT vs Type+Priority only): Mean MAE difference is -0.0428 points. Ticket-level 95% CI is [-0.0811, -0.0066] (excludes 0: True). Project-level 95% CI is [-0.0872, 0.0209] (excludes 0: False). S-BERT semantic text provides a statistically significant improvement at the individual ticket level, but not across project-level cluster resampling."
